  "sop1_t": "Daily task check.",
  "sop1_b": "Every working day, before going home, open My Board. For each task choose one: still in progress, on hold (write who you are waiting for, or why), or done (send proof). At most 3 tasks in progress at once: finish one before starting a new one. A task that reaches its due date becomes Due, then Overdue.",
